Here is the definition of "zetro" in jbovlaste:
x1 is 1x10**21 of x2 in dimension/aspect x3 (default is units)  
    
In 1 x 10**21, the multiplication "x" and the following "1" are treated as a 
letter "x" with a subscript "1".  

I have not searched for other instances of this sort of typo.

stevo
    


